---
// Página pública de demos de un vendedor: /demo/<enlace>. Netlify sirve esta misma página
// para cualquier /demo/* (netlify.toml) y el script lee el enlace de la URL.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { DEMO_MINUTES } from '../../../supabase/functions/_shared/availability';

const units = ['Menos de 50', '50 a 150', 'Más de 150'];
---

<Base
  title="Agende una demo · Tezontle 3D"
  description="Agende una demo de Tezontle 3D: showroom virtual 3D con inventario en vivo para preventas."
  tag="Demo · Tezontle 3D"
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] sm:rounded-[36px]">
    <img
      src="/piedra.jpg"
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      fetchpriority="high"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[78%_85%]"
    />
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-arena/95 via-arena/70 via-45% to-transparent max-sm:bg-linear-to-b max-sm:from-arena/95 max-sm:via-arena/85 max-sm:via-60% max-sm:to-arena/30"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="relative px-6 py-12 sm:px-12 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="mb-7 block h-1.5 w-16 rounded-full bg-laton"></span>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-tinta-suave uppercase">Showroom virtual 3D para preventas</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-4xl leading-[1.08] sm:text-6xl">Agende una demo de Tezontle 3D.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-tinta-suave sm:text-lg">
        Le mostramos cómo sus compradores eligen su departamento desde el celular: la maqueta 3D, el panel de ventas
        con inventario en vivo y la landing de su desarrollo.
      </p>

      <div id="seller-card" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-cal/85 py-2 pr-5 pl-2 backdrop-blur-md">
        <span id="seller-initials" class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-grafito font-display text-lg text-cal">·</span>
        <span class="leading-tight">
          <span id="seller-name" class="skeleton block h-4 w-32 rounded font-semibold"></span>
          <span id="seller-title" class="mt-1 block text-sm text-tinta-suave"></span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm font-medium">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-cal/80 px-3.5 py-2 backdrop-blur-md">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-piedra" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          {DEMO_MINUTES} minutos
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-cal/80 px-3.5 py-2 backdrop-blur-md">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-piedra" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="13" height="12" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
          Google Meet
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-cal/80 px-3.5 py-2 backdrop-blur-md">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-piedra" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-5.6-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.4-7 11-7 11Z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"></circle></svg>
          Hora de Ciudad de México
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="not-found" hidden class="card mt-6 px-6 py-12 text-center sm:mt-8 sm:py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl">No encontramos esta agenda.</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-tinta-suave">
      Revise el enlace que le compartieron o pídale a su asesor de Tezontle 3D uno nuevo.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="picker" class="card mt-6 grid gap-10 p-6 sm:mt-8 sm:p-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] lg:gap-14" aria-labelledby="picker-title">
    <div>
      <h2 id="picker-title" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
        <span class="step-num font-sans">1</span> Elija un día
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-tinta-suave">Los días con punto tienen horarios libres.</p>
      <div id="weekday-head" class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-5 gap-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-piedra uppercase sm:gap-3"></div>
      <div id="days" class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-5 gap-2 sm:gap-3" role="group" aria-label="Días disponibles">
        {Array.from({ length: 15 }).map(() => <div class="skeleton aspect-square rounded-2xl"></div>)}
      </div>
      <p id="days-month" class="mt-4 text-sm text-tinta-suave"></p>
      <p id="no-slots" hidden class="mt-4 rounded-2xl bg-arena px-5 py-4 text-sm text-tinta-suave">
        Por ahora no hay horarios disponibles en esta agenda. Vuelva a revisar en unos días.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
        <span class="step-num font-sans">2</span> Elija la hora
      </h2>
      <p id="selected-day-label" class="mt-2 text-sm text-tinta-suave">Primero elija un día.</p>
      <div id="slots" class="mt-6 space-y-2.5" role="group" aria-label="Horarios"></div>
      <p id="tz-note" hidden class="mt-4 text-xs text-tinta-suave"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="details" hidden class="card mt-6 p-6 sm:mt-8 sm:p-10" aria-labelledby="details-title">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-14">
      <div>
        <button id="back" type="button" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tinta-suave hover:text-grafito">
          <svg class="h-3 w-4" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 1 1 6l5 5M1 6h14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
          Cambiar horario
        </button>
        <h2 id="details-title" class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
          <span class="step-num font-sans">3</span> Sus datos
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-arena p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-tinta-suave uppercase">Su demo</p>
          <p id="summary-date" class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl first-letter:uppercase"></p>
          <p id="summary-time" class="mt-1 font-medium text-tinta-suave"></p>
          <p id="summary-with" class="mt-3 text-sm text-tinta-suave"></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form id="booking-form" class="space-y-4" novalidate>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <label for="f-name" class="block text-sm font-semibold">Nombre completo</label>
            <input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="120" class="field mt-1.5" placeholder="Su nombre y apellido" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="f-company" class="block text-sm font-semibold">Desarrolladora</label>
            <input id="f-company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" required minlength="2" maxlength="120" class="field mt-1.5" placeholder="Nombre de la desarrolladora" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <label for="f-email" class="block text-sm font-semibold">Correo electrónico</label>
            <input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200" class="field mt-1.5" placeholder="nombre@empresa.com" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="f-phone" class="block text-sm font-semibold">WhatsApp</label>
            <input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required minlength="7" maxlength="40" class="field mt-1.5" placeholder="55 1234 5678" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <label for="f-city" class="block text-sm font-semibold">Ciudad del proyecto</label>
            <input id="f-city" name="city" type="text" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" class="field mt-1.5" placeholder="CDMX, Tulum, Querétaro…" />
          </div>
          <fieldset>
            <legend class="block text-sm font-semibold">Número de departamentos</legend>
            <div class="mt-1.5 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
              {units.map((u, i) => (
                <label class="cursor-pointer">
                  <input type="radio" name="units" value={u} required class="peer sr-only" id={`f-units-${i}`} />
                  <span class="flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-arena px-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold transition-colors peer-checked:bg-grafito peer-checked:text-cal peer-focus-visible:outline-2 peer-focus-visible:outline-laton">
                    {u}
                  </span>
                </label>
              ))}
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -left-[9999px]" aria-hidden="true">
          <label>No llenar <input name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
        </div>

        <p id="form-error" role="alert" hidden class="rounded-xl bg-rojo-tezontle/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-rojo-tezontle"></p>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 pt-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <button id="submit" type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">Confirmar demo</button>
          <p class="text-xs text-tinta-suave">Le enviaremos la invitación con el enlace de Meet a su correo.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="done" hidden class="card mt-6 px-6 py-12 text-center sm:mt-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-16" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="mx-auto grid h-16 w-16 place-items-center rounded-full bg-arena">
      <svg class="h-7 w-7 text-grafito" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
    </div>
    <h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl sm:text-5xl">¡Listo! Su demo está agendada.</h2>
    <p id="done-when" class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium first-letter:uppercase"></p>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-lg text-tinta-suave">
      Le enviamos la invitación con el enlace de Google Meet a <strong id="done-email" class="text-grafito"></strong>.
      Si no la ve, revise su carpeta de spam.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
      <a id="done-meet" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">Abrir enlace de Meet</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="../../scripts/demo.ts"></script>
</Base>
